      "end_ms": 10320,
      "start_frame": 245,
      "end_frame": 310,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside it, use a while loop.",
      "start_ms": 10780,
      "end_ms": 13100,
      "start_frame": 323,
      "end_frame": 393,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Not a single if, because every swap can bring another misplaced value to the same index.",
      "start_ms": 13900,
      "end_ms": 19820,
      "start_frame": 417,
      "end_frame": 595,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "The first condition keeps the value between 1 and n.",
      "start_ms": 20300,
      "end_ms": 24140,
      "start_frame": 609,
      "end_frame": 724,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "This also makes its home index safe to access.",
      "start_ms": 24600,
      "end_ms": 27760,
      "start_frame": 738,
      "end_frame": 833,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "The second condition checks whether the home already holds this value.",
      "start_ms": 28100,
      "end_ms": 32760,
      "start_frame": 843,
      "end_frame": 983,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "If it does, stop.",
      "start_ms": 33320,
      "end_ms": 34960,
      "start_frame": 1000,
      "end_frame": 1049,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Especially for duplicates.",
      "start_ms": 35760,
      "end_ms": 37640,
      "start_frame": 1073,
      "end_frame": 1129,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Set home to the value minus 1, then swap those two positions.",
      "start_ms": 38220,
      "end_ms": 42200,
      "start_frame": 1147,
      "end_frame": 1266,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "After all placements, scan from the left.",
      "start_ms": 42780,
      "end_ms": 45040,
      "start_frame": 1283,
      "end_frame": 1351,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "If the value at index i is not i plus 1, return e plus 1, the earliest missing number.",
      "start_ms": 45540,
      "end_ms": 52600,
      "start_frame": 1366,
      "end_frame": 1578,
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "If every position matches, return n plus 1.",
      "start_ms": 53240,
      "end_ms": 56760,
      "start_frame": 1597,
      "end_frame": 1703,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "No extra array.",
      "start_ms": 57320,
      "end_ms": 58560,
      "start_frame": 1720,
      "end_frame": 1757,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "No hash set.",
      "start_ms": 59080,
      "end_ms": 60000,
      "start_frame": 1772,
      "end_frame": 1800,
      "word_count": 3
    }
  ],
